WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.458
Walk through the guide as a first-time user.

00:00:03.458 --> 00:00:09.942
Failure one: the message says the guide is available but provides no name or location.

00:00:09.942 --> 00:00:15.994
Correct it with the designated delivery message and a link labeled Estimate Practice Guide.

00:00:15.994 --> 00:00:20.750
Identify the delivery owner if the message or link is missing.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:28.098
Failure two: the help note says ask a question but gives no route, owner or expected response.

00:00:28.098 --> 00:00:33.718
Supply an approved contact route, the responsible role and a labeled acknowledgment assumption.

00:00:33.718 --> 00:00:39.770
Ask only for the resource name, stage reached and a brief non-sensitive issue description.

00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:43.661
AI may organize that summary or draft a reply.

00:00:43.661 --> 00:00:49.712
The human checks the issue and supplies an authorized access route or corrected instruction.

00:00:49.712 --> 00:00:53.603
Retain both corrections and unresolved policy and capacity checks.
